$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=dchrindinj  LOC_AFTER=?

* The inducing map is injective (Mathlib changeLevel_injective): two characters mod N with the same induced character mod M are equal. The lifting coprmlift supplies, for every integer coprime to N, a congruent integer coprime to M at which both induced characters can be read.

